One test file per unit of behaviour. Never a feature-wide or module-wide dump
file — those become append-only and nobody reads them.

`{{DOUBLES_LOCATION}}` holds fakes and fixtures only — never a test, never a
helper with a rule in it. Production code, including the composition root, never
imports from it.

